{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Pain relief - Weight management - Performance\nMultipurpose protein for every body"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Relieves pain\nBoosts metabolism\nEnhances sports performance\nPromotes muscle gain\nPrevents muscle loss\nMaintains bone health\nFor your good health Terry"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Unconditionally guaranteed"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Curamin Enhanced Whey Protein\n-Multipurpose protein for every body"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Curamin is an award-winning supplement for safe and effective pain relief."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Curamin Enhanced Whey Protein combines Curamin with a blend of the concentrate and isolate forms of whey protein that contain the branched chain amino acids (BCAA) you need for superior muscle benefits. Whey concentrate metabolizes slowly for sustained benefits and satisfaction; whey isolate digests quickly for faster absorption and recovery."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Curamin Enhanced Whey Protein delivers the fuel you need for an active life!"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Pain relief - Contains superior absorption, clinically studied curcumin and boswellia, along with DLPA and ginger for pain relief."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Weight management - Supports lean muscle mass, helps burn calories more efficiently, and supports satiation so you feel full longer.\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Exercise recovery - Feel better, faster, so you can spend more time being active and less time recovering."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Sports performance - Easily utilized protein for energy and stamina, with amino acids to help boost strength and muscle gain.\nPromotes muscle gain - Whey protein provides powerful building blocks for muscle strength."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Prevents muscle loss - Maintains proper muscle tome and helps prevent muscle tissue loss due to aging or inactivity.\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Builds bones - Adequate calcium as part of a healthy diet, along with physical activity, may reduce the risk of osteoporosis in later life."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions For Use: Mix 1 scoop daily in your favorite beverage or stir into food. Increase use if desired."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BCM-95 and BosPure are registered trademarks of Dolcas-Biotech, LLC."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"In conjunction with a healthy diet and exercise regimen\nOccasional muscle pain due to exercise or overuse"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten-free\nNon-GMO"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No: Salt, yeast, wheat, gluten, soy, artificial flavoring, artificial coloring, or artificial preservatives."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For recipes and the complete amino acid profile, go to Curamin.com"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Terry Naturally EuroPharma"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"JC 34 91 + 3(5,6)EP P20354.01"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0124","langualCodeDescription":"Approved Health"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2018-04-25","type":"Date entere